"segments": [
{
"start": 3025.05,
"end": 3031.25,
"text": " of the sweetest people I've ever known, because we could relate to each other."
},
{
"start": 3031.53,
"end": 3034.01,
"text": "We'd share something in common with the press."
},
{
"start": 3034.71,
"end": 3037.83,
"text": "I don't think they hounded anyone more than her and myself."
},
{
"start": 3038.64,
"end": 3043.32,
"text": "And we had a relationship, a very good relationship, where we would call each other"
},
{
"start": 3045.24,
"end": 3060.74,
"text": " late at night for me and we would you know just talk about just like cry on each other's shoulders how hard and difficult and how mean the tabloids can be and how they lie and twist stories around."
},
{
"start": 3061.78,
"end": 3073.76,
"text": "But she came to a concert at Wimberley Stadium in London and you know they do when the Royal Family comes you have to line up and you meet"
},
{
"start": 3074.64,
"end": 3075.8,
"text": " for family and everything."
},
{
"start": 3077.04,
"end": 3087.73,
"text": "But at some point, she called me away from the line, and I saw Prince Charles look at me, and I said, oh boy."
},
{
"start": 3088.89,
"end": 3089.91,
"text": "She said, I wanna talk to you."
},
{
"start": 3090.09,
"end": 3091.93,
"text": "So I said, yeah, what's happening?"
},
{
"start": 3092.57,
"end": 3096.83,
"text": "She said, are you gonna do Dirty Diana tonight?"
},
{
"start": 3097.61,
"end": 3100.99,
"text": "I said, no, no, I took it out of the show, out of respect for you."
},
{
"start": 3101.61,
"end": 3103.07,
"text": "She said, that's my favorite song."
}
]
